snippet.description:
Our trip down to the AL/FL Gulf Coast, started with a quick activation at Gulf State Park, US-1042.  The ATAS-120A did not disappoint.  I'm really loving this mobile setup.  For a shortened, very compromised antenna, the ATAS really performs.
For those who jsut don't have hours to devote to an activation, this thing is amazing.  Just pull into the park, hit the tune button, and you're off to the races.
